Two required fields missing from a body under a label that has to be
quoted: the help writes both in the body, which it names quoted.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	"crew-roster": {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		id: v0_0.id
		"crew-roster": {}
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	"crew-roster": {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0346]: ForwardLens produces nothing for "crew-roster".owner and "crew-roster".team, which v1.0 requires
  --> history/1.0.thema:13:3
   |
13 |         "crew-roster": {}
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: add owner: <mapping>, team: <mapping> to v1_0."crew-roster"
